    "detailed_description": "<h1>SEE ALSO OUR NEW GAME!</h1><p><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>[img]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/1cd68a9a1259a731fdf8f6b477a3c73d.avif?t=1658684951\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/aeba5db048964d32a7438e2adbef882c.poster.avif?t=1658684951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/aeba5db048964d32a7438e2adbef882c.webm?t=1658684951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/aeba5db048964d32a7438e2adbef882c.mp4?t=1658684951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/9b935487be63284dc68d9e34beb6dece.poster.avif?t=1658684951\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/9b935487be63284dc68d9e34beb6dece.webp?t=1658684951\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>The green fire has been abducted by evil aliens, who force him to solve puzzles for tests. Need to pass all the tests to be able to return the green fire back to his home. You have to brainstorm over 50 levels. Gravity, movement, killing lasers... What else the aliens have prepared?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/5c3739c08fc27471b1fb474035d137eb.poster.avif?t=1658684951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/5c3739c08fc27471b1fb474035d137eb.webm?t=1658684951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/5c3739c08fc27471b1fb474035d137eb.mp4?t=1658684951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/618daaf787b335090cb4ec2f3d61fdd3.poster.avif?t=1658684951\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/618daaf787b335090cb4ec2f3d61fdd3.webp?t=1658684951\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Gravity control<br></li><li>50 mind-bending levels<br></li><li>Many different mechanics<br></li><li>Bright pixel graphics</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/1cd68a9a1259a731fdf8f6b477a3c73d.avif?t=1658684951\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/aeba5db048964d32a7438e2adbef882c.poster.avif?t=1658684951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/aeba5db048964d32a7438e2adbef882c.webm?t=1658684951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/aeba5db048964d32a7438e2adbef882c.mp4?t=1658684951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/9b935487be63284dc68d9e34beb6dece.poster.avif?t=1658684951\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/9b935487be63284dc68d9e34beb6dece.webp?t=1658684951\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>The green fire has been abducted by evil aliens, who force him to solve puzzles for tests. Need to pass all the tests to be able to return the green fire back to his home. You have to brainstorm over 50 levels. Gravity, movement, killing lasers... What else the aliens have prepared?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/5c3739c08fc27471b1fb474035d137eb.poster.avif?t=1658684951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/5c3739c08fc27471b1fb474035d137eb.webm?t=1658684951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/5c3739c08fc27471b1fb474035d137eb.mp4?t=1658684951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/618daaf787b335090cb4ec2f3d61fdd3.poster.avif?t=1658684951\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470970/extras/618daaf787b335090cb4ec2f3d61fdd3.webp?t=1658684951\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Gravity control<br></li><li>50 mind-bending levels<br></li><li>Many different mechanics<br></li><li>Bright pixel graphics</li></ul>",
